1.กระบวนการ render component ของ VUE
  แบ่งเป็น 4 Phase
  Creation Phase: 
  	Component is initialized, but not yet in DOM
  Mounting Phase: 
  	Component is inserted into the DOM
  Updating Phase: 
  	Triggered when reactive data changes
  Unmounting Phase: 
  	Component is removed from DOM

2.VUE3 Hook Function
  1.Creation Phase: Component is initialized, but not yet in DOM
    setup() (Composition API)
    beforeCreate() (Options API - rarely used now)
    created() 

2.Mounting Phase: Component is inserted into the DOM
    onBeforeMount()
    onMounted()

3.Updating Phase: Triggered when reactive data changes
    onBeforeUpdate()
    onUpdated()
4.Unmounting Phase: Component is removed from DOM
    onBeforeUnmount()
  onUnmounted();

